description	"Maw

A strong and formidable Dark Jedi with repulsorlift technology allowing him flight.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- 8% more Purple damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

