- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Grip (1) ^3[CS3]
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
-- Regen: 1/.15s
- Strength (1)
- Brawler Guard
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Blast Armor
- Force Block (2)
- 15% less knockback taken"